(6804050, 1023272, 62249, '<td valign="top">Funny concept. Not sure it''s one that necessarily benefits from the diptych treatment, but I like your creativity.</td>', 'Funny concept. Not sure it''s one that necessarily benefits from the diptych treatment, but I like your creativity.', '2012-06-29 02:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6804057, 1023004, 62249, '<td valign="top">Average concept. Average execution, especially considering you had Expert Editing at your disposal. Maybe position the hands so the knuckles appear to be in contention. Also, the speck in the lower left and upper right is distracting. I like the idea of the thumbs up and thumbs down. Think you could''ve pushed it more to get either more drama or more humor out of it.</td>', 'Average concept. Average execution, especially considering you had Expert Editing at your disposal. Maybe position the hands so the knuckles appear to be in contention. Also, the speck in the lower left and upper right is distracting. I like the idea of the thumbs up and thumbs down. Think you could''ve pushed it more to get either more drama or more humor out of it.', '2012-06-29 02:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6804059, 1023127, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good storytelling in this one. The way the smoke curl overlaps the mustache looks a little odd.</td>', 'Good storytelling in this one. The way the smoke curl overlaps the mustache looks a little odd.', '2012-06-29 02:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
