(6804200, 1023393, 49773, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had an interesting subject, but I find the choice of framing not the best. The fence reflection in the upper photo is a bit distracting, and the perspective doesn''t show much of the fin. Also the crop is a bit too tight on the lower photo imo.</td>', 'Looks like you had an interesting subject, but I find the choice of framing not the best. The fence reflection in the upper photo is a bit distracting, and the perspective doesn''t show much of the fin. Also the crop is a bit too tight on the lower photo imo.', '2012-06-29 07:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6804201, 1022802, 49773, '<td valign="top">I love the feel. What I would prefer more is to have either of the men (preferably the right one) and have something related to him as the second part of the diptych, I think that''d tell the story much better.</td>', 'I love the feel. What I would prefer more is to have either of the men (preferably the right one) and have something related to him as the second part of the diptych, I think that''d tell the story much better.', '2012-06-29 07:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6804263, 1023388, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent work; I was drawn in by the sensuality of the shot, along with the tangerine tones, and I stayed for the catch light and lensbaby style blur. In fact, I am going to go as far as to say you should quit your day job and exclusively shoot indie-rock album covers.</td>', 'Excellent work; I was drawn in by the sensuality of the shot, along with the tangerine tones, and I stayed for the catch light and lensbaby style blur. In fact, I am going to go as far as to say you should quit your day job and exclusively shoot indie-rock album covers.', '2012-06-29 10:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6804266, 1023387, 12611, '<td valign="top">I have one of them at home! beautiful pp work, and a great job keeping it photographic in nature as well.</td>', 'I have one of them at home! beautiful pp work, and a great job keeping it photographic in nature as well.', '2012-06-29 10:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
