(6805854, 1022876, 108982, '<td valign="top">Love this photo, really captured the spirit of the challenge.  I''ll assume the words are on glass making them perfectly acceptable.  Nice capture(s)great message.</td>', 'Love this photo, really captured the spirit of the challenge.  I''ll assume the words are on glass making them perfectly acceptable.  Nice capture(s)great message.', '2012-07-01 22:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6805858, 1022803, 108982, '<td valign="top">Absolutely spot on in keeping with the theme of the challenge.  outstanding composition and use of white space.  Just a tick of surrealism, which I love.  What I really dig the most is that you DID NOT make them respectively opposite.  the vantage point is the same in both.  This leads me to believe that the two were photographed at the same time and split or you took incredible pains to move all the objects.  at any rate it creates an underlying look that these photos belong together regardless of what is in the photo.  Very cool 10.</td>', 'Absolutely spot on in keeping with the theme of the challenge.  outstanding composition and use of white space.  Just a tick of surrealism, which I love.  What I really dig the most is that you DID NOT make them respectively opposite.  the vantage point is the same in both.  This leads me to believe that the two were photographed at the same time and split or you took incredible pains to move all the objects.  at any rate it creates an underlying look that these photos belong together regardless of what is in the photo.  Very cool 10.', '2012-07-01 22:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6805861, 1023362, 108982, '<td valign="top">I really liked this and believe it would have been even higher for me had you been able to bring in the train a little louder. I liked and got exactly the message but wasn''t convinced by the post-processing.</td>', 'I really liked this and believe it would have been even higher for me had you been able to bring in the train a little louder. I liked and got exactly the message but wasn''t convinced by the post-processing.', '2012-07-01 22:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
