(6810524, 1023287, 117474, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a hard enough image to look at, to be honest. I think the lack of a proper division between the two images is what makes it feel off to me. <br/>Definitely tells a story, but it really needed your notes to complete it (you can''t really expect us to do research when voting!). I could see this in a nature magazine or something. Still, my head feels fuller after reading your comments and notes, so thanks :-) <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-07-06 06:50:07.</i></td>', 'I thought this was a hard enough image to look at, to be honest. I think the lack of a proper division between the two images is what makes it feel off to me. Definitely tells a story, but it really needed your notes to complete it (you can''t really expect us to do research when voting!). I could see this in a nature magazine or something. Still, my head feels fuller after reading your comments and notes, so thanks :-) ', '2012-07-06 07:49:59.000000', '2012-07-06 07:50:07.000000', 0),
