(6816542, 1023160, 66267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JamesDowning:</b></div><hr/><i> I don''t quite understand this one.  What''s it trying to say? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>on the left side is a nice blue planet. on the right side is the same planet in the future, with a smoggy atmosphere and pollution from global warming. i chose warm reds for the right half to help illustrate the motive of heat. the message seems pretty stark to me.</td>', 'Originally posted by JamesDowning: I don''t quite understand this one.  What''s it trying to say?   on the left side is a nice blue planet. on the right side is the same planet in the future, with a smoggy atmosphere and pollution from global warming. i chose warm reds for the right half to help illustrate the motive of heat. the message seems pretty stark to me.', '2012-07-12 19:53:56.000000', NULL, 0),
