(6827900, 1023160, 146356, '<td valign="top">i want to has your photoshop skillz. Some questions for you if you don''t mind answering (if you do, just ignore me).<br/> <br/>If i were to begin this project, I''ld likely run an action that does the night sky or take shots in a nice area with clear skies and start there. <br/> <br/>My sun would be a flash looking at me shot as a seperate image. The sphere would likely be an articificial drwaing or the outline of a tennis ball.<br/> <br/>Pictures of waters and clouds would make the surface and the difference would mostly be a temperature and tonal difference.<br/> <br/>How did you go about doing this?</td>', 'i want to has your photoshop skillz. Some questions for you if you don''t mind answering (if you do, just ignore me). If i were to begin this project, I''ld likely run an action that does the night sky or take shots in a nice area with clear skies and start there.  My sun would be a flash looking at me shot as a seperate image. The sphere would likely be an articificial drwaing or the outline of a tennis ball. Pictures of waters and clouds would make the surface and the difference would mostly be a temperature and tonal difference. How did you go about doing this?', '2012-07-26 10:23:20.000000', NULL, 0),
